WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.680
I do consider Emily my best friend.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.100
She is this wonderful, elegant person.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.400
She is an enigma, my wife. When you are closer you never quite reach her.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:39.140
Everybody has a dark side. Some of us are better at hiding it than others.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:54.900
Five days ago

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.800
Emily went missing.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:01.300
I`m realising I don`t know her as well as I thought I did.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:06.800
Emily,

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
If you are out there, we are all really worried.

